"""
CDMFT-ED (pyqcm) 2x2 plaquette 

Description:

CDMFT calculation using pyqcm library

This set of scripts configures and runs CDMFT-ED calculations for a 2x2 plaquette cluster using the pyqcm package.
Defines explicitly the bath parametrization, the lattice model and the cluster geometry, performing the self-consistent cycle.

Authors:
- Vitor Assunção Moreira Lima (vitor.aml@hotmail.com)
-

Created: 2026-04-08
Last Modified: 2026-04-08
Version: 1.0.0

License: MIT 

Dependencies:
- Python > 3.10.x
- pyqcm >= 2.10.4

Structure:
The package is organized in three parts:
i) A documentation folder (doc) where some useful information will be stored;
ii) A CDMFT run folder (plaquette) with subfolders associated to different types of calculations;
iii) An utils folder (putils) with auxiliary scripts to plot data or filter output information;

For more information please read the README files inside the desired directory or go to the official documentation website https://qcm-wed.readthedocs.io/en/latest/index.html !
"""
